5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is high time we updated our utility arrangement. Since we are now five instead of three, the old logic no longer holds. Let us be rational about this.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I agree! It's getting a bit confusing, isn't it? I want to make sure we find a way that's easy for everyone and doesn't take forever to figure out!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Peace in the house is paramount. I believe we should investigate whether our current distribution is truly equitable before we commit to a new system.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Jonathan. We need a clear understanding of the actual costs over a full year before we decide on a permanent change.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us all to be happy. I hope we can find a way that doesn't make anyone feel bad or upset when the bills come.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"To that end, I will look into the ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room"" and ""Winter habits at a house paying ahead"" to see how behavior changes.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'll check the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" and ""Monthly settle observed at another house""! I want to see how much work the paperwork actually is.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will examine the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled"" to see where the friction lies.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I'll look at ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms"" to understand the financial fluctuations and potential setup costs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll look at the ""Kitchen notice about the cooler"" and ""Sunlight and heating need by room"" to see if some rooms are harder to keep comfortable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"This seems like a comprehensive approach. We are covering the technical, administrative, and social aspects of the problem.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, you're so organized! I'm just worried that if it's too complicated, we'll just end up arguing again.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"That is precisely why we are gathering data, Mio. Evidence is the best cure for arguments.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. Once we have the figures, the path forward should be logically apparent.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope the data shows that we can all just be kind to each other.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
